ent. Permissionless by design.\"}},\"notice\":\"ERC-8004 does not let a registry decide who is trustworthy. Anyone may leave         feedback about an agent; readers decide whose feedback counts by filtering         `getSummary` to a client allow-list. That design is what stops a single         privileged writer from owning an agent's track record, and it is why the         arena leaves feedback as a *client* rather than as an admin: a judge can         read the arena's score for an agent without having to trust the arena.         Scores are 0..100. Feedback is append-only and revocable only by its author.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/erc8004/ReputationRegistry.sol\":\"ReputationRegistry\"},\"evmVersion\":\"cancun\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[]},\"sources\":{\"src/erc8004/ReputationRegistry.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x94e98a403fa9884aa589fa3ed16db32b54ab457bf8dda5379819aada3f379bbd\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://bb22e256868cba245f5046f82f963ed5062d3d26e69a8a618a934afbe6164f57\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmPLtZjo5oaiU5XpJtfbUYztEMhMqi3GtA5KC2bUQBqWEH\"]},\"src/interfaces/IAgentRegistry.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x3d6e0a44f307f969bdb65e2809ecaf0d6ee3f9bcea94b6cee1fd46ae6d83e727\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://09aaa7a2665d87cdbabcdc7e3a09343fb6338149f4d401b94af2e5c84680e554\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmWx3azpKnarbdsSGZpvxz11x8pYP2mjwk76t3RGqK2o4o\"]}},\"version\":1}","metadata":{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.24+commit.e11b9ed9"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[{"internalType":"contract IIdentityRegistry","name":"_identity","type":"address"}],"stateMutability":"nonpayable","type":"constructor"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"AlreadyRevoked"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"NoSuchFeedback"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"ScoreOutOfRange"},{"inputs":[],"type":"error","name":"UnknownAgent"},{"inputs":[{"internalType":"uint256",